claim clm:embedding-geometry-carries-economics
  status STANDING
  verification MEASURED_TWICE_INDEPENDENTLY
  claim Segment embedding geometry carries loss economics that is not present in the descriptor text.
  method 745 business x peril segments; for each, do its 8 nearest neighbours sit closer in log value-per-loss than a random draw
  control value-per-loss never appears in the descriptor text as a readable number; descriptors carry counts and totals only
  measurement_a direct cosine: hash +19.2%, onnx +25.9%, delta +6.7 pts
  measurement_b bonfyre-vec ANN (sqlite-vec SIMD): hash +19.4%, onnx +24.9%, delta +5.5 pts
  consequence the hashed-token store was recovering roughly three quarters of the available structure; real semantics adds the rest
  note the two paths agree within about one point, which is why both are recorded rather than the better one

