  constraint consumed by a real-valued ranker, NOT by TernaryRanker

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# THE TWO REVERSALS -- the part worth carrying forward
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

claim clm:ssm-refusal-was-instrument-error
  status REVERSED
  verification MEASURED
  origin refused 2026-08-27 morning, reversed 2026-08-27 same session
  original_claim Per-cell temporal state carries no material signal; the 45.1% ceiling is not a memory problem.
  original_evidence adding SSM state moved nothing; replacing cell value lost 1.1 pts; dormancy recovered +0.1 pts against a 1.0 pt bar
  what_was_wrong the measurement was taken through route_ranker.TernaryRanker, whose {-1,0,+1} weights cannot express "this feature is worth a third of cell value". The ranker rounded the signal to nothing and the measurement honestly reported nothing.
  how_it_was_caught the refusal was cooled with an explicit reheat condition, "the ranker itself changes from ternary to real-valued weights". The capacity test fired that condition the same session.
  corrected_result under real-valued weights the SSM adds +1.7 pts aggregate and +1.3 pts recent on top of dequantization
  lesson a negative result from an instrument that cannot represent the effect is not evidence of absence; write the reheat condition or the direction closes permanently on an artifact

claim clm:ternary-quantization-costs-capture
  status STANDING
  verification MEASURED
  claim route_ranker.TernaryRanker's {-1,0,+1} weights cost real capture on this workload.
  evidence 12-fold walk-forward, identical features: ternary 45.1%, real-valued 47.4%
  evidence the cost concentrates in recent folds -- 2023 +5.1, 2025 +5.0, 2026 +9.8 -- so it is widening, not a fixed tax
  scope ternary routing stays correct and cheap; it is lossy as a VALUE RANKER, which is a different job
  caveat the real-valued comparator is a correlation-scaled mean difference, not a fitted model, so +2.3 pts is a FLOOR on the quantization cost
  headroom oracle ranking of the same candidates reaches 83.0%; about 34 pts is unreachable by any reweighting of these five features and points at the candidate set, not the model

claim clm:recency-anti-predicts-in-a-catastrophe-book
  status STANDING
  verification MEASURED
  claim Raw recency-weighted cell state anti-predicts next-year fee capture.
  evidence substituting SSM state for lifetime value cost 1.1 pts, worst folds 2020 -8.1 and 2026 -5.0
  evidence the state is NOT redundant with lifetime value -- rank agreement 0.759 -- and separates live from dead cells 14.5x
  interpretation fee value lands where the book has been quiet; the gate has to be fit rather than assumed, and the sign is not the intuitive one
  consequence the useful temporal signal exists but must be learned, which is precisely what a fixed-decay EMA cannot do and what the ternary ranker could not hold

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DEFECTS FOUND IN BONFYRE'S OWN TOOLING
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

defect def:bonfyre-vec-silent-dim-mismatch
  status OPEN
  verification REPRODUCED
  target bonfyre-vec insert
  symptom prints "N vectors inserted" and exits 0 when the embedding dimension does not match the store's vec0 column, which is float[384]
  effect rows land in artifacts but never in the vector index; count then reads "artifacts: N, vectors: 0" and every search returns empty
  reproduced 256-dim hash embeddings against a default store
  blast_radius a comparison whose CONTROL arm fails this way scores 0 and makes the treatment arm look artificially good; it produced a false admitted=True in this session before it was caught
  fix_shape nonzero exit or a stderr warning on dimension mismatch

defect def:bonfyre-embed-silent-onnx-fallback
  status OPEN
  verification REPRODUCED
  target bonfyre-embed --backend onnx
  symptom reports "backend=onnx-native" on the banner line while the per-file tag reads hashed-token-native, and exits 0, when the model directory does not resolve
  aggravating the banner goes to STDERR, not stdout, so a guard that reads stdout alone sees nothing and can pass on no evidence
  fix_shape nonzero exit when an explicitly requested backend is unavailable

